# round 72 (w89): seeds 2703 to 2705 of the elastic program at capacity scale 100, the OTHER way of removing the absorbing state. Round 71 showed the hard program on this box is bimodal (2 of 6 at chance, 2 of 6 above 0.80) and that the looser turnover tier removes the collapse and the high end together; the elastic program at three seeds read 0.704, 0.741, 0.697, so this takes it to six.
